{"id":"cf7c0598a6","t":"The Crown Prince That Sells Medicine","c":"cv","n":130,"l":130,"s":["ml","mg","az"],"k":{"ml":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine","mg":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine","az":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine"},"u":1795219301261,"desc":"[من نفس مؤلف المهندس الأفضل في العالم] أنا ولي العهد؟ ولي العهد الضعيف والمريض في الرواية؟ لكنني طبيب متخصص في الطب الكوري التقليدي. أعتقد أنه ما باليد حيلة. إعادة تشكيل الهيكل الداخلي واستعادة طاقتي وتنشيط الطاقة الحيوية وزيادتها. لأعتنين بجسدي جيدًا من الآن فصاعدًا! تقع أحداث المانهوا بنفس عالم لويد فرونتيرا بعد حقبة زمنية، كما أن الأمير سليل لويد. ولي عهد ضعيف ومريض يعيش حوالي 3 أشهر فقط بعد تناسخه في جسد الأمير.","type":"مانهوا","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","تناسخ","طبي","كوميدى","مغامرة"],"src":{"ml":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine","mg":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine","az":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine|/manga/the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine/1/","mg":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine|","az":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine|/series/the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine/chapter-1"},"2":{"ml":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine|/manga/the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine/2/","mg":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine|"},"3":{"ml":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine|/manga/the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine/3/","mg":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine|"},"4":{"ml":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine|/manga/the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine/4/","mg":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine|"},"5":{"ml":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine|/manga/the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine/5/","mg":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine|"},"6":{"ml":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine|/manga/the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine/6/","mg":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine|"},"7":{"ml":"the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine|/manga/the-crown-prince-that-sells-medicine/7/","mg":"the-crown